AgentHarbor
Modifications copyright 2026 vitalto (https://github.com/vitalto/AgentHarbor)

AgentHarbor is a modified version of CloudCLI UI
(https://github.com/siteboon/claudecodeui). It was modified by vitalto in 2026
and is distributed under the same license (AGPL-3.0-or-later, including the
additional terms under Section 7 in the LICENSE file). AgentHarbor is not the
original CloudCLI UI and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Siteboon AI B.V.

Summary of modifications:

- Claude runtime replaced: instead of running Claude Code through the Agent SDK
  or in stream-json mode, every agent is an interactive Claude Code TUI in a
  tmux window. Web messages are typed into the TUI, the chat renders the
  session's .jsonl transcript live, TUI menus (permission prompts, questions,
  trust dialog) are shown as buttons, and the terminal tab attaches to the same
  tmux window. A SessionStart hook maps tmux panes to Claude sessions; Claude's
  own session status files drive the activity indicators.
- Support for driving the Windows Claude Code binary from WSL tmux, with
  Windows <-> WSL path translation.
- Removed: the Codex, Cursor, OpenCode and Gemini providers, voice input,
  TaskMaster / PRD editor, browser use, scheduled messages, /api/agent, the
  Electron desktop app, the Docker sandbox command, edit-and-resend, fork,
  model / effort / permission pickers, AI-generated commit messages, links to
  the hosted CloudCLI service, and release / Docker / translated-README files.
- Renamed to AgentHarbor (package, CLI command, UI, data directory
  ~/.agentharbor) with a new logo.
